# Demonic Junker: "If a creature you controlled was destroyed this way, put two +1/+1 counters on this Vehicle" (CR 701.8,
# 702.12b, 608.2c). Bot1's slot takes its own Darksteel Myr, which is indestructible and is not destroyed, and Bot2's slot takes
# Bot2's Ornithopter, which is. A creature was destroyed, and a creature Bot1 controlled was targeted, but none Bot1 controlled
# was destroyed: the Junker gets no counters. Black Lotus pays the Myr; with Mox Jet, Mox Pearl, Mox Ruby, Mox Sapphire and the
# Myr (five artifacts) the Junker costs {1}{B}, paid by Jet and Pearl.

